window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>You've heard of the Little Mermaid: a naive mermaid, a bargain with the sea-witch, and a happily ever after with a charming prince. This is <i>not </i>that story... On the night of her Emergence ceremony, Delphine ascends to the surface world for the first time, ready to claim her first victim. But instead of luring a man to his death with her siren song, Delphine saves Prince Elian. Believing she's found love and desperate for a human life, the siren makes a gamble with the feared sea-witch. Delphine barters her voice, her essence, <i>everything</i>. But when Delphine's life on land quickly unravels, she faces a horrifying fate: transformation into lifeless sea foam. Her only hope now rests with the sea-witch. But her help comes at a price, a price far steeper than Delphine could ever imagine…Meanwhile, jaded by a life of bargains, the sea-witch finds herself strangely drawn to Delphine's plight. But manipulation and jealousy consume her. As Nerissa wrestles with her past demons and a growing desire for Delphine, a hunger awakens within her cold heart. Will her dark magic be enough to save Delphine from the inevitable transformation. Or will their desires lead them both to a watery grave? Prepare to be swept away by a tale of gothic romance, vengeance, and a sapphic love as dangerous as the sea...</p>"; 
